    value: <style=title><size=28>BUCKS COMBO</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_RHINO
    value: "<size=18>-  3 or more consecutive             from leftmost reel triggers
      Bucks Combo.\n\n-              pays in accordance with way win combination.\n\n-
      \ The total amount of Bucks Combo is the total sum of coin values on              multiplied
      by the number of\n\n   way win combinations. \n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE
    value: <style=title><size=28>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE
    value: '<size=18>-  3 or more consecutive Bonus Symbols from leftmost reel triggers
      Free Games.


      -  In Free Games, Wild substitutes for all symbols and appears with x2 multiplier
      on reels 2, 3 and 4 only.


      -  In Free Games, 3 or more consecutive Bonus Symbols from leftmost reel awards
      additional Free Games.


      -  In Free Games, if there are combination wins of               , pay the same
      manner in Base Games.


      -  In Free Games, for               that are not part of way win combination,
      pay them separately.


      -  Only when way win combination includes               , award the total sum
      of coin values with              .'
